HangOut Cafe — Website PRD
Client: HangOut Cafe (Ye Amruttulya Chai), Nowgong Address: Near Swarnim City, Chhatarpur Road, Nowgong, Distt. Chhatarpur (M.P.) Phone: 8770480966 | Instagram: @hangoutcafe03 | Timing: 11 AM – 11 PM Type: Pure Veg cafe — chai, coffee, shakes, fast food (burger, pizza, noodles, maggi, pasta, rolls)

1. Goal
Ek fun, mobile-first single-page website jo cafe ki vibe (string-lights, outdoor night hangout, youth crowd) ko online laaye — log menu dekhein, location/timing confirm karein, aur ek tap mein call/order kar sakein. Yeh sales brochure hai, transactional ordering system nahi.

2. Target Users
Local youth/college crowd, Nowgong & Chhatarpur — mostly mobile browsing.
New visitors searching "cafe near me" — need address, timing, veg confirmation fast.
Existing Instagram followers — want quick menu + contact link.
3. Success Metrics
Click-to-call rate on "Call Now" button.
Clicks on Google Maps link / Instagram link.
Time-on-menu-section (proxy for menu clarity).
4. Sitemap (single scrolling page + anchors)
Hero — real storefront photo, name, tagline, Call Now + View Menu CTA, rating/timing strip.
3D Scroll Story — pinned reel-style section, 6 scenes (details in section 5A).
About/Story — pure-veg identity, "food is my secret meal, only love" ethos.
Full Menu — 19 categories in tabs (Chinese, Fries, Sweet Corn, Pav Bhaji, Pizza, Soups, Roll, Biryani, Chhole Special, Paneer Kulche, Mojito, Tea, Coffee, Shake, Sandwich, Maggi, Noodles, Burger, Pasta) with every item and price, plus a real-dish photo strip.
The Vibe — night hangout / string-lights outdoor seating, with chai photo.
Reviews — Google rating (4.8, 50 reviews), short summary and six customer testimonials (paraphrased).
Visit Us — address, timing, phone, Instagram link.
Footer — social + credit line.
